    "description": "• Led end-to-end release management using Gearset for metadata comparisons, selective deployments, and rollbacks\nacross sandbox and production environments — reducing deployment errors by streamlining pre-release validation.\n• Drove Copado adoption for pipeline automation and compliance-driven DevOps, establishing branching strategies\nand deployment governance across multiple geographically distributed teams.\n• Designed and led the Git branching strategy for 3+ parallel development teams, improving release predictability\nand reducing merge conflicts.\n• Built and maintained Lightning Web Components (LWC) and Apex classes using SOQL to deliver custom UI and\nbusiness logic aligned with enterprise requirements.\n• Automated business processes using Flow Builder and Process Builder, reducing manual intervention and\naccelerating time-to-completion on key workflows.\n• Administered Salesforce production environment: user roles, profiles, permission sets, sharing rules, security settings,\nand role hierarchy.\n• Implemented Service Cloud Console including Email-to-Case, Web-to-Case, Assignment, Escalation, and Autoresponse rules.\n• Migrated data using Data Loader and ETL tools; maintained data quality through dashboards, monitoring processes,\nand integrity checks.\n• Created workflow rules, approval processes, and defined field updates, email alerts, and outbound messages.\n• Mentored junior developers on deployment best practices, Apex coding standards, and Agile/Scrum workflows.\n• Collaborated with QA and cross-functional teams through full SDLC — requirements gathering through post-release\nvalidation.",
